; MADRIGUERA - Tilo (player), 8x16 sprite mode, OBP0 0xE4. Sprite tiles 0-45 (GDD 7.2, scene play/ending).
; Each 16x16 frame = 4 tiles: F = left half (top, bottom), F+2 = right half -> oam16(F) + oam16(F+2) at x+8.
; Walk: X_A / X_B alternate every 8 f (DOWN, UP, SIDE). SIDE_* and STAB_SIDE face RIGHT: for left use
; S_FLIPX and swap the halves (F+2 at x, F at x+8). Bell-shaped cap = Tilo's silhouette.
; STAB_*: pose held during the 14 f stab. HURT: knockback pose (+ the 4/4 f blink).
; Sword (separate sprites, OAM 2-3): SWORD_V = 1 sprite, blade up, hilt at the bottom: up stab at
; (x+4, y-12); down stab = S_FLIPY at (x+4, y+12). SWORD_H = 2 sprites (hilt half at x+12, blade half at
; x+20, y+0), blade on rows 10-12; left = S_FLIPX with halves swapped at x-12 / x-20.
; 46 tiles = budget. Lift-item pose (M2, GDD 7.1) not drawn yet: needs +4 tiles (see report).
; Generated by a scratch script; this file is the source of truth now.

